BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20240928-snl-alert@snl-calendar
DTSTAMP:20260803T125942Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20240928T233000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20240929T010000
SUMMARY:SNL Season 50 Premiere: Jean Smart / Jelly Roll
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S50:E1\n"Saturday Night Live" launches its milestone 50th seas
 on on Sept. 28 with Jean Smart hosting for the first time. The six-time Em
 my Award winner just won her third Emmy for Outstanding Lead Actress in a 
 Comedy Series for her work on "Hacks\," streaming on Max. Jelly Roll make
 s his musical guest debut. Currently on tour\, the Grammy Award-nominated 
 artist's new album\, "Beautifully Broken\," will be released Oct. 11.
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT5M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:SNL starts in 5 minutes
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20241005-snl-alert@snl-calendar
DTSTAMP:20260803T125942Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241005T233000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241006T010000
SUMMARY:SNL: Nate Bargatze / Coldplay
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S50:E2\nNate Bargatze makes his second appearance as "SNL" host
  on Oct. 5. Bargatze's "The Be Funny Tour" continues this fall with dates 
 nationwide.  Coldplay performs as musical guest for the eighth time. The
  band's 10th studio album\, "Moon Music\," will be released Oct. 4
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT5M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:SNL starts in 5 minutes
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20241012-snl-alert@snl-calendar
DTSTAMP:20260803T125942Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241012T233000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241013T010000
SUMMARY:SNL: Ariana Grande / Stevie Nicks
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S50:E3\nAriana Grande hosts "SNL" for the second time on Oct. 1
 2. Following this year's release of her latest album\, "Eternal Sunshine\,
 " the Grammy winner next stars in "Wicked\," in theaters Nov. 22. Stevie 
 Nicks marks her second appearance as musical guest\, following her first a
 ppearance in 1983. Nicks is a Grammy-winning singer-songwriter and two-tim
 e Rock & Roll Hall of Fame inductee.
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT5M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:SNL starts in 5 minutes
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20241019-snl-alert@snl-calendar
DTSTAMP:20260803T125942Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241019T233000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241020T010000
SUMMARY:SNL: Michael Keaton / Billie Eilish
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S50:E4\nMichael Keaton returns to host "SNL" for the fourth tim
 e on Oct. 19. The award-winning actor stars in "Beetlejuice Beetlejuice\,"
  currently in theaters\, and "Goodrich\," in theaters on Oct. 18.  Billi
 e Eilish takes the stage as musical guest for the fourth time. The Grammy-
 winning artist will launch a worldwide tour this fall\, supporting her new
 est album\, "HIT ME HARD AND SOFT."
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT5M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:SNL starts in 5 minutes
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20241102-snl-alert@snl-calendar
DTSTAMP:20260803T125942Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241102T233000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241103T010000
SUMMARY:SNL: John Mulaney / Chappell Roan
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S50:E5\nJohn Mulaney hosts for the sixth time on Nov. 2. The Em
 my winner stars in the new Broadway play\, "All In: Comedy About Love\," o
 pening Dec. 11. Chappell Roan makes her musical guest debut. Her album\, 
 "The Rise and Fall of a Midwest Princess\," has spent nine weeks in the To
 p 5 on the Billboard 200\, and her latest single\, "Good Luck\, Babe!\," h
 as amassed nearly 1 billion streams.
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT5M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:SNL starts in 5 minutes
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
