DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241109T233000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241110T010000
SUMMARY:SNL: Bill Burr / Mk.gee
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S50:E6\nBill Burr returns to host "Saturday Night Live" for the
  second time on Nov. 9. The Emmy and Grammy Award nominee is currently on 
 tour with his "Bill Burr Live" show.\nMk.gee performs as a musical guest f
 or the first time. He is currently on a world tour with his critically acc
 laimed debut album\, "Two Star & The Dream Police."
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT5M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:SNL starts in 5 minutes
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
