DTSTAMP:20260803T125942Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241207T233000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241208T010000
SUMMARY:SNL: Paul Mescal / Shaboozey
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S50:E8\n"Gladiator II" star Paul Mescal hosts the Dec. 7 episod
 e featuring musical guest Shaboozey. Both appear for the first time.
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT5M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:SNL starts in 5 minutes
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20241214-snl-alert@snl-calendar
DTSTAMP:20260803T125942Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241214T233000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241215T010000
SUMMARY:SNL: Chris Rock / Gracie Abrams
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S50:E9\nChris Rock returns on Dec. 14 for his fourth time as SN
 L Host. The actor-comedian was a cast member from 1990 to 1993\, and previ
 ously hosted in November 1996\, November 2014\, and October 2020. Rock is 
 joined by The Secret of Us singer Gracie Abrams\, making her SNL debut as 
 Musical Guest.
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT5M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:SNL starts in 5 minutes
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20241221-snl-alert@snl-calendar
DTSTAMP:20260803T125942Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20241221T233000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20241222T010000
SUMMARY:SNL: Martin Short / Hozier
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S50:E10\nMartin Short returns for his third time as individual 
 host — and fifth overall — on Dec. 21. He was a cast member for one se
 ason — from 1984 to 1985 — and returned the following year\, in 1986\,
  to host with his Three Amigos! co-stars Chevy Chase and Steve Martin. S
 hort hosted solo in December 1996 and December 2012 and then returned in D
 ecember 2022 to co-host with his Only Murders in the Building co-star\, 
 Steve Martin.\nHozier is the musical guest\, his second time performing on
  SNL. The "Too Sweet" singer celebrates the December 6 release of Unreal
  Unearth: Unending\, the deluxe version of his hit 2023 album\, Unreal Un
 earth.
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT5M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:SNL starts in 5 minutes
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:20250118-snl-alert@snl-calendar
DTSTAMP:20260803T125942Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250118T233000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250119T010000
SUMMARY:SNL: Dave Chappelle / GloRilla
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S50:E11\n"Saturday Night Live" will return Jan. 18 with Dave Ch
 appelle making his fourth appearance as host. The Emmy Award winner's late
 st special\, "Dave Chappelle: The Dreamer\," is nominated for a Grammy Awa
 rd for Best Comedy Album.GloRilla will make her musical guest debut. The m
 ulti-platinum selling artist received two Grammy nominations this year for
  her hit single "Yeah Glo!"
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT5M
ACTION:DISPLAY
