UID:20250301-snl-alert@snl-calendar
DTSTAMP:20260803T125942Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250301T233000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250302T010000
SUMMARY:SNL: Shane Gillis / Tate McRae
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S50:E13\nShane Gillis will host "Saturday Night Live" for the s
 econd time on March 1. Gillis is the star and co-creator of the series "Ti
 res\," which returns this year for its second season on Netflix.\nTate McR
 ae will take the stage as musical guest for the second time. Her highly an
 ticipated third album\, "So Close To What\," is set for release Feb. 21.
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT5M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:SNL starts in 5 minutes
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
