DTSTAMP:20260803T125942Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250308T233000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250309T010000
SUMMARY:SNL: Lady Gaga
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S50:E14\nOn March 8\, Lady Gaga will do double duty for the sec
 ond time\, marking her second appearance as host and fifth appearance as m
 usical guest. The Grammy and Academy Award winner's newest album\, "MAYHEM
 \," is due out March 7.
