DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250330T010000
SUMMARY:SNL: Mikey Madison / Morgan Wallen
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S50:E15\nMikey Madison will make her "Saturday Night Live" host
 ing debut on March 29. Madison won the Academy Award for Best Actress in a
  Leading Role for her work in "Anora\," now playing in theaters and on dem
 and.\nMorgan Wallen will make his second appearance as musical guest. The 
 19-time Billboard Music Awards winner kicks off a tour this summer in supp
 ort of his upcoming album\, "I'm The Problem."
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT5M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:SNL starts in 5 minutes
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
