DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250405T233000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250406T010000
SUMMARY:SNL: Jack Black / Elton John & Brandi Carlile
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S50:E16\nJack Black will host "SNL" for the fourth time on Apri
 l 5. Black stars in the upcoming film "A Minecraft Movie\," in theaters Ap
 ril 4.\nElton John and Brandi Carlile will appear together as musical gues
 t for the first time. Their collaborative studio album\, "Who Believes In 
 Angels?" including the Oscar-nominated song "Never Too Late\," will be rel
 eased April 4.
