DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250412T233000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250413T010000
SUMMARY:SNL: Jon Hamm / Lizzo
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S50:E17\nJon Hamm will host "SNL" for the fourth time on April 
 12. Hamm executive produces and stars in the new series "Your Friends and 
 Neighbors\," premiering April 11 on AppleTV+.\nLizzo will take the stage a
 s musical guest for the fourth time. The Emmy and four-time Grammy Award w
 inner just debuted "Still Bad\," the newest single from her highly anticip
 ated next album\, "Love in Real Life."
BEGIN:VALARM
TRIGGER:-PT5M
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:SNL starts in 5 minutes
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
