DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250503T233000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250504T010000
SUMMARY:SNL: Quinta Brunson / Benson Boone
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S50:E18\nQuinta Brunson will host "Saturday Night Live" for the
  second time on May 3. The Emmy and Golden Globe Award winner is the star 
 and creator of ABC's "Abbott Elementary."\nBenson Boone will perform as mu
 sical guest for the first time. The Grammy-nominated\, multi-platinum sell
 ing artist will release his next album "American Heart" on June 20.
