DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20250510T233000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20250511T010000
SUMMARY:SNL: Walton Goggins / Arcade Fire
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S50:E19\nWalton Goggins will host "SNL" for the first time on M
 ay 10. Goggins stars in the third season of "The White Lotus" and the fina
 l season of "The Righteous Gemstones\," both streaming on Max.\nArcade Fir
 e will take the stage as musical guest for the sixth time. The Grammy Awar
 d-winning band will release their new album\, "Pink Elephant\," on May 9.
