DTSTAMP:20260803T125942Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20251004T233000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20251005T010000
SUMMARY:SNL Season 51 Premiere: Bad Bunny / Doja Cat
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S51:E1\nThe 51st season of "Saturday Night Live" will premiere 
 Oct. 4 with Bad Bunny returning for his second turn as host. The three-tim
 e Grammy Award winner kicks off his highly anticipated world tour this fal
 l\, celebrating his critically acclaimed album\, "DeBÍ TiRAR MáS FOToS."
 \nDoja Cat will make her "SNL" musical guest debut. The Grammy winner's fi
 fth album\, "Vie\," will be released Sept. 26.
