SUMMARY:SNL: Amy Poehler / Role Model
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S51:E2\nOn Oct. 11\, Amy Poehler will return to Studio 8H for h
 er second individual "SNL" hosting appearance and third overall. The Emmy 
 and Golden Globe Award winner hosts the popular podcast "Good Hang with Am
 y Poehler."\nRole Model will perform as musical guest for the first time. 
 He just marked his first Billboard No. 1 song with "Sally\, When the Wine 
 Runs Out" topping the Adult Alternative Airplay chart.
