SUMMARY:SNL: Miles Teller / Brandi Carlile
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S51:E4\nMiles Teller will host "Saturday Night Live" for the se
 cond time on Nov. 1. Teller stars in and executive produces the film "Eter
 nity\," in theaters Nov. 26.\nBrandi Carlile will return as musical guest 
 for her third individual appearance and fourth overall. The 11-time Grammy
  Award winner's new album\, "Returning to Myself\," will be released Oct. 
 24.
