DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20251116T010000
SUMMARY:SNL: Glen Powell / Olivia Dean
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S51:E6\nGlen Powell will host "SNL" for the first time on Nov. 
 15. The Golden Globe nominee stars in "The Running Man\," in theaters Nov.
  14\, and co-created and stars in "Chad Powers\," now streaming on Hulu.\n
 Olivia Dean will make her musical guest debut. Dean is currently on tour i
 n support of her latest album\, "The Art of Loving\," which has reached #1
  in five countries.
