SUMMARY:SNL: Melissa McCarthy / Dijon
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S51:E7\nMelissa McCarthy will return to host "Saturday Night Li
 ve" for the sixth time on Dec. 6. The two-time Academy Award nominee won a
 n Emmy Award for hosting "SNL" in 2017.\nDijon will perform as musical gue
 st for the first time. He's currently nominated for two Grammy Awards and 
 is on tour in support of his album\, "Baby."
