DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20251214T010000
SUMMARY:SNL: Josh O'Connor / Lily Allen
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S51:E8\nJosh O'Connor will make his "SNL" hosting debut on Dec.
  13. The Emmy winner stars in "Wake Up Dead Man: A Knives Out Mystery\," i
 n select theaters Nov. 26 and streaming Dec. 12 on Netflix.\nLily Allen wi
 ll make her second appearance as musical guest. The Grammy-nominated artis
 t just released her fifth album\, "West End Girl."
