DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20251221T010000
SUMMARY:SNL: Ariana Grande / Cher
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S51:E9\nAriana Grande will host "SNL" for the third time on Dec
 . 20. The Academy Award-nominated and Grammy winning multi-hyphenate stars
  in "Wicked: For Good\," in theaters Nov. 21.\nCher will take the stage as
  musical guest for the second time following her first appearance in 1987.
  The Oscar\, Emmy and Grammy Award winner's autobiography\, "Cher: The Mem
 oir" is currently available in paperback.
