SUMMARY:SNL: Finn Wolfhard / A$AP Rocky
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S51:E10\nFinn Wolfhard will host "Saturday Night Live" for the 
 first time on Jan. 17. Wolfhard stars in the global hit series "Stranger T
 hings\," with the entire series now streaming on Netflix.\nA$AP Rocky will
  take the stage as the musical guest for the first time. The multi-platinu
 m selling artist's fourth album\, "Don't Be Dumb\," will be released Jan. 
 16.
