SUMMARY:SNL: Teyana Taylor / Geese
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S51:E11\nTeyana Taylor will make her first hosting appearance o
 n Jan. 24. Taylor has received Golden Globe\, Critics Choice and Actor Awa
 rd nominations for "One Battle After Another" and is Grammy nominated for 
 her album "Escape Room."\nGeese will perform as musical guest for the firs
 t time. The band is currently on a world tour in support of its critically
  acclaimed album\, "Getting Killed."
