SUMMARY:SNL: Connor Storrie / Mumford & Sons
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S51:E13\n"Saturday Night Live" will return Feb. 28 with Connor 
 Storrie making his hosting debut. Storrie stars in the breakout hit series
  "Heated Rivalry\," with the first season currently streaming on HBO Max.\
 nMumford & Sons will make their fourth appearance as musical guest. The Gr
 ammy Award-winning band's new album\, "Prizefighter\," is set for release 
 Feb. 20.
