SUMMARY:SNL: Ryan Gosling / Gorillaz
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S51:E14\nRyan Gosling will host "SNL" for the fourth time on Ma
 rch 7. The Academy Award-nominated actor produces and stars in the new fil
 m "Project Hail Mary\," in theaters March 20.\nGorillaz will perform as mu
 sical guest for the first time. "The Mountain\," the new album from the Gr
 ammy-winning band\, will be released Feb 27.
