SUMMARY:SNL: Harry Styles
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S51:E15\nHarry Styles will return to "Saturday Night Live" on M
 arch 14\, doing double duty as host and musical guest for the second time.
 \nThe Grammy Award winner's "Together\, Together" tour launches this sprin
 g in support of his album\, "Kiss All the Time. Disco\, Occasionally.\," d
 ue out March 6.
