SUMMARY:SNL: Jack Black / Jack White
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S51:E16\nJack Black will host "Saturday Night Live" for the fif
 th time on April 4. Black stars in "The Super Mario Galaxy Movie\," in the
 aters April 1.\nJack White will return for his fifth individual appearance
  as musical guest and sixth overall. White is a 12-time Grammy Award winne
 r and 2025 Rock & Roll Hall of Fame inductee.
