SUMMARY:SNL: Olivia Rodrigo
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S51:E18\nOlivia Rodrigo will do double duty as "Saturday Night 
 Live" host and musical guest on May 2\, marking her hosting debut and thir
 d time as musical guest. The Grammy Award winner's new album\, "you seem p
 retty sad for a girl so in love\," will drop June 12.
