SUMMARY:SNL: Matt Damon / Noah Kahan
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S51:E19\nMatt Damon will host "SNL" for the third time on May 9
 . The Academy Award winner next stars in Christopher Nolan's "The Odyssey\
 ," in theaters July 17.\nNoah Kahan will perform as musical guest for the 
 second time. The Grammy nominated\, multi-platinum artist's highly anticip
 ated fourth album\, "The Great Divide\," will be released April 24.
