SUMMARY:SNL Season 51 Finale: Will Ferrell / Paul McCartney
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
DESCRIPTION:S51:E20\nWill Ferrell will host the 51st season finale on May 1
 6\, returning to Studio 8H to host "SNL" for the sixth time. The Emmy Awar
 d winner executive produces and stars in the new comedy series "The Hawk\,
 " premiering this summer on Netflix.\nPaul McCartney will take the stage a
 s musical guest for the fifth time. The incomparable musician's new album\
 , "The Boys of Dungeon Lane\," is set for release May 29.
